  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital Public Goods platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the project UNICEF&apos;s Office of Innovation will develop a prototype of a platform for increasing discoverability and use of Digital Public Goods by individuals, public and private sector institutions and other stakeholders in  low-and middle income countries. Facilitating engagement and usage of the digital public goods by SMEs will be emphasized.</narrative>
  </description>
